# Benign seed: Write Single Coil (function 0x05), value ON (0xFF00).
# A valid, well-formed Modbus/TCP request. This is the function family the
# known bug lives in, but this frame is correctly sized and does not trigger it.
# MBAP header: txn=0001 proto=0000 length=0006 unit=FF
# PDU: fn=05 addr=0x0130 (unit-test coil base) value=0xFF00 (ON)
00 01 00 00 00 06 FF 05 01 30 FF 00
